      <title>量子电池原型飞秒充电成功 但能量快速流失成致命缺陷</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260831/%E9%87%8F%E5%AD%90%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0%E5%8E%9F%E5%9E%8B%E9%A3%9E%E7%A7%92%E5%85%85%E7%94%B5%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F-%E4%BD%86%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E6%B5%81%E5%A4%B1%E6%88%90%E8%87%B4%E5%91%BD%E7%BC%BA%E9%99%B7/</link>
